  "title": "SpyGlass Pharma Announces Pricing of Initial Public Offering",
  "summary": "ALISO VIEJO, Calif., Feb. 05, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- SpyGlass Pharma, Inc. (Nasdaq: SGP) (“SpyGlass Pharma”), a late-stage biopharmaceutical company, today announced the pricing of its initial public offering of 9,375,000 shares of its common stock at a public offering price of $16.00 per share.",
